        "original_id": "b232f78c-8a19-5c2b-9a2d-379860f473b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Brooks, Dewayne Blackwell, David Frizzell\n- Songs: \"Friends in Low Places\", \"Mr. Blue\", \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\", \"The Thunder Rolls\"\n- Albums: \"No Fences\"\n- Charts: Billboard Top Country Albums\n\nFacts:\n- \"Mr. Blue\" was a 1959 hit song written by Dewayne Blackwell and recorded by the Fleetwoods.\n- \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\" was a 1982 hit song written by Dewayne Blackwell and recorded by David Frizzell.\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" is a song performed by American country pop artist Garth Brooks.\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" was a 1990 hit song written by Dewayne Blackwell for Garth Brooks.\n- Garth Brooks released \"Friends in Low Places\" on August 6, 1990 as the lead single from the album \"No Fences\".\n- Garth Brooks released the album \"No Fences\" on August 27, 1990.\n- \"No Fences\" reached number 1 on Billboard's Top Country Albums chart.\n- Garth Brooks released \"The Thunder Rolls\" in April 1991 as the fourth and final single from the album \"No Fences\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "eaef773d-3456-5372-a0cc-3e521f92b25e",
        "text": "Page: Friends in Low Places. Sentence: \"Friends in Low Places\" is a song performed by American country pop artist Garth Brooks.\nPage: Friends in Low Places. Sentence: It was released on August 6, 1990 as the lead single from his album \"No Fences\".\nPage: No Fences. Sentence: It was released on August 27, 1990, and reached #1 on \"Billboard's\" Top Country Albums chart.\nPage: Dewayne Blackwell. Sentence: His songs include \"Mr. Blue\", a 1959 hit for the Fleetwoods; \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\", a 1982 hit for David Frizzell; and \"Friends in Low Places\", a 1990 hit for Garth Brooks.\nPage: The Thunder Rolls. Sentence: It was released in April 1991 as the fourth and final single from his album \"No Fences\".",
